            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Names inside a function belong to that function.</strong> <code>symbol</code>, <code>shares</code> and <code>cost_so_far</code> exist only while it runs, so they need no underscore, and two functions can each use <code>price</code> without colliding.</span></span>"
