            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Why a dictionary.</strong> A value with a space in it has to be encoded before it can go in an address, and <code>params=</code> does that for you. Ask for <code>{\"name\": \"West Newbury\"}</code> and <code>.url</code> ends in <code>name=West+Newbury</code>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The reply is a dictionary with two keys. <code>pagination</code> states how much there is.</span></span>"
