            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"c-read-the-documentation\">\u270f\ufe0f C \u00b7 Read the documentation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Open <a href=\"https://oim.zhili.dev/docs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">oim.zhili.dev/docs</a> and find <code>/ma/towns</code>. Use its parameters to ask for the five Norfolk towns with the highest income per person, highest first. Let the server do the sorting.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><em>Check yourself: Dover, Wellesley, Cohasset, Needham, Westwood.</em></span></span>"
